# chorus golden vector: firmware chunk, protocol v2 message type 0x19.
#
# Committed, and never written by a test. Any implementation of chorus protocol v2 must
# produce these exact bytes from the canonical input in firmware_chunk.fields, and recover
# exactly those fields from them (docs/protocol.md, "0x19 firmware chunk").
#
# Format: whitespace separated hex bytes, '#' starts a comment.

# frame header: type 0x19, payload length 24 (0x0018), big-endian
19 00 18

# transfer = 7
00 00 00 07

# offset = 8192
00 00 20 00

# data: the rest of the frame, 16 bytes
E9 06 02 20 A0 82 37 40 EE 00 00 00 09 00 00 00
